(379701, 31986, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is actually a clever idea. Too bad the background is so fuzzy. Maybe use a tripod or steady yourself to avoid camera shake. Also suggestion, if you are working in image editing program, the subjects should have a little shadow around their legs, which would look more real.</td>', 'This is actually a clever idea. Too bad the background is so fuzzy. Maybe use a tripod or steady yourself to avoid camera shake. Also suggestion, if you are working in image editing program, the subjects should have a little shadow around their legs, which would look more real.', '2003-08-07 02:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
