(379741, 32192, 3554, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  The only nit pick I have is the white of the eye on the right seems out of place (too bright). It''d like to see that muted a bit.</td>', 'Very creative.  The only nit pick I have is the white of the eye on the right seems out of place (too bright). It''d like to see that muted a bit.', '2003-08-07 02:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
