(379768, 31870, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very nice montage. Too bad JPGs don''t deal too god with dots on a dark background. Love the colour vs. dark blue contrast. BTW, what is "Gobstopper" ??</td>', 'Very nice montage. Too bad JPGs don''t deal too god with dots on a dark background. Love the colour vs. dark blue contrast. BTW, what is "Gobstopper" ??', '2003-08-07 02:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
