(379783, 32267, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice montage with beautiful background. Their faces are a little bit oversaturated though. The circular colour separation doesn''t do much for me. The whole image would have looked better in the sepia tone as it would have balanced with the old background look. But I still like your image.</td>', 'Nice montage with beautiful background. Their faces are a little bit oversaturated though. The circular colour separation doesn''t do much for me. The whole image would have looked better in the sepia tone as it would have balanced with the old background look. But I still like your image.', '2003-08-07 02:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(379784, 31820, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is great for "the future" shot. Challenge definitely met. I would have suggested to remove the line on the right side and some of the white text which people will not understand anyway. It takes attention away from the fetus. I had the same idea for this challenge, but decided not to do it since I am not pregnant and we were not allowed to scan images. Good luck on your delivery :-)</td>', 'This is great for "the future" shot. Challenge definitely met. I would have suggested to remove the line on the right side and some of the white text which people will not understand anyway. It takes attention away from the fetus. I had the same idea for this challenge, but decided not to do it since I am not pregnant and we were not allowed to scan images. Good luck on your delivery :-)', '2003-08-07 02:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
