(380598, 32267, 9504, '<td valign="top">I think your idea and concept is great.  I see a blue cast however which takes away from the photo a little bit -- too much exposure too.  The setting however is superb.  I like the architectural detail.</td>', 'I think your idea and concept is great.  I see a blue cast however which takes away from the photo a little bit -- too much exposure too.  The setting however is superb.  I like the architectural detail.', '2003-08-07 13:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(380605, 32361, 9504, '<td valign="top">Great execution of this.  Fabulous!  There are a few other clones in this challenge and I think I like yours second best.  The reason I ranked the other one higher was because of the interactive/party scene that was conveyed.  You really believed the guy was interacting with himself.<br/> <br/>So, while you have an outstanding photo --good on all levels -- that interactivity really gives the other photo an edge.  I''m sorry....I just wanted to be honest with you as to why I voted you a 9 instead of a 10.</td>', 'Great execution of this.  Fabulous!  There are a few other clones in this challenge and I think I like yours second best.  The reason I ranked the other one higher was because of the interactive/party scene that was conveyed.  You really believed the guy was interacting with himself. So, while you have an outstanding photo --good on all levels -- that interactivity really gives the other photo an edge.  I''m sorry....I just wanted to be honest with you as to why I voted you a 9 instead of a 10.', '2003-08-07 13:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
