(381972, 31783, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and a nice take on the challenge!  I especially like the subdued tones and feeling imparted by the desaturation and sepia tone.  One point of distraction is that the headstones in the background are a bit out of focus-- rather than completely out of focus, or razor-sharp.  Perhaps either a shallower or deeper DOF might have served the shot a bit better.  --8</td>', 'Great shot, and a nice take on the challenge!  I especially like the subdued tones and feeling imparted by the desaturation and sepia tone.  One point of distraction is that the headstones in the background are a bit out of focus-- rather than completely out of focus, or razor-sharp.  Perhaps either a shallower or deeper DOF might have served the shot a bit better.  --8', '2003-08-08 13:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(381973, 32301, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious! I think I''d like it better if the background were simply blurred (as in out-of focus) rather than this mix of motion blur and grainyness</td>', 'Very mysterious! I think I''d like it better if the background were simply blurred (as in out-of focus) rather than this mix of motion blur and grainyness', '2003-08-08 13:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
