(382144, 31947, 2553, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I get a very distinctly sad, almost depressed feeling when looking at this shot.  I really like the black and white (duotones??), it adds to the desolate feel.  I particularly like the composition - the slope of the ground, and the bare trees create an unsettling feeling of starkness. Great execution of concept.</td>', 'Well done.  I get a very distinctly sad, almost depressed feeling when looking at this shot.  I really like the black and white (duotones??), it adds to the desolate feel.  I particularly like the composition - the slope of the ground, and the bare trees create an unsettling feeling of starkness. Great execution of concept.', '2003-08-08 18:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(382145, 32047, 2553, '<td valign="top">I was thinking more "distant future" than "near future", but I do love this shot.  Good DOF, and I very much like that the background has similar colors that enhance the subject well. I like the simple border, it works well with the shot.</td>', 'I was thinking more "distant future" than "near future", but I do love this shot.  Good DOF, and I very much like that the background has similar colors that enhance the subject well. I like the simple border, it works well with the shot.', '2003-08-08 18:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(382146, 32259, 7994, '<td valign="top">how did you do it?  this is the best in this challenge!</td>', 'how did you do it?  this is the best in this challenge!', '2003-08-08 18:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(382147, 32326, 7994, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent photo.  how did you do it?</td>', 'this is an excellent photo.  how did you do it?', '2003-08-08 18:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(382149, 32335, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, and I am a sucker for black and white.  I feel like I want just a touch more brightness to this though.  The overall feel is somewhat dark to me.  I also find my eyes bouncing up and down trying to look at the hands, but then being drawn away by the more complex pattern of the flowers.</td>', 'I like this shot, and I am a sucker for black and white.  I feel like I want just a touch more brightness to this though.  The overall feel is somewhat dark to me.  I also find my eyes bouncing up and down trying to look at the hands, but then being drawn away by the more complex pattern of the flowers.', '2003-08-08 18:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(382150, 31779, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love this!  The blue/white against the black is great, and the composition is very engaging.  There seems to be a lot to look at, and yet the eye is always drawn to the light at the end.  A very imaginative and well done shot.</td>', 'I love this!  The blue/white against the black is great, and the composition is very engaging.  There seems to be a lot to look at, and yet the eye is always drawn to the light at the end.  A very imaginative and well done shot.', '2003-08-08 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(382153, 31483, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely took my breath away the moment it came up on my screen. This shot actually gives me chills.  Composition is compelling, as is the color treatment that you used.  Can''t wait to see how you did this. A visually engaging shot, no doubt, but it''s one of those things that you don''t want to look at, but you just can''t help yourself.  Terrific execution of the challenge.  (Hopefully people realize that "nuclear" means "nuclear weapons", NOT "nuclear power"!</td>', 'Absolutely took my breath away the moment it came up on my screen. This shot actually gives me chills.  Composition is compelling, as is the color treatment that you used.  Can''t wait to see how you did this. A visually engaging shot, no doubt, but it''s one of those things that you don''t want to look at, but you just can''t help yourself.  Terrific execution of the challenge.  (Hopefully people realize that "nuclear" means "nuclear weapons", NOT "nuclear power"!', '2003-08-08 18:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(382155, 32331, 2553, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, no question - good lighting and well composed, but does not have the impact that I would like to see with this challenge.</td>', 'An interesting shot, no question - good lighting and well composed, but does not have the impact that I would like to see with this challenge.', '2003-08-08 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(382156, 32333, 2553, '<td valign="top">OH!  Creep me out!  This is another shot that you don''t even want to look at, but you just can''t look away!  What a concept, but I prefer kitties just the way they are, thank you!</td>', 'OH!  Creep me out!  This is another shot that you don''t even want to look at, but you just can''t look away!  What a concept, but I prefer kitties just the way they are, thank you!', '2003-08-08 18:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(382159, 32236, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape, but I was hoping for something a little more dynamic with this challenge!  I suppose that you could get "the future" with this, but it''s a stretch for me!  Not crazy about the double border.</td>', 'Lovely landscape, but I was hoping for something a little more dynamic with this challenge!  I suppose that you could get "the future" with this, but it''s a stretch for me!  Not crazy about the double border.', '2003-08-08 18:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(382160, 32050, 2553, '<td valign="top">Hmm, very nice.  An incredibly appealing composition, and I love the colors of the shot. Very simple, but I definitely get "future" from it.</td>', 'Hmm, very nice.  An incredibly appealing composition, and I love the colors of the shot. Very simple, but I definitely get "future" from it.', '2003-08-08 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(382163, 31335, 2553, '<td valign="top">Yes, very much forboding.  An interesting shot, though I find it a little too dark for my taste.  I feel like it all kinds of "runs together" - everything seems a little indistinct.  I love the clouds though.  The composition is somewhat "off" for me - not really visually engaging, and my eyes are constantly drawn to the clouds, rendering the rest of the photo virtually invisible.</td>', 'Yes, very much forboding.  An interesting shot, though I find it a little too dark for my taste.  I feel like it all kinds of "runs together" - everything seems a little indistinct.  I love the clouds though.  The composition is somewhat "off" for me - not really visually engaging, and my eyes are constantly drawn to the clouds, rendering the rest of the photo virtually invisible.', '2003-08-08 19:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(382168, 31783, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but the shot just doesn''t "feel" right to me.  Enough of the shot is out of focus that it makes me feel as though my eyes can''t focus properly.  The glaring brightness of the cross, and the lightness of the stones near it make the shot feel somewhat unbalanced to me since the other side is so dark, and doesn''t seem to add anything to the shot. Perhaps a tighter crop on the cross and the stones behind it would have more impact.</td>', 'I like the concept here, but the shot just doesn''t "feel" right to me.  Enough of the shot is out of focus that it makes me feel as though my eyes can''t focus properly.  The glaring brightness of the cross, and the lightness of the stones near it make the shot feel somewhat unbalanced to me since the other side is so dark, and doesn''t seem to add anything to the shot. Perhaps a tighter crop on the cross and the stones behind it would have more impact.', '2003-08-08 19:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(382169, 31792, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am obviously missing something!  But then, I don''t get out much.  Is the FLOWER the deadly intruder, or is there a deadly intruder that I AM missing???  I like the composition and the DOF, but would like to have seen more light on this side of the flower,  It seems a little dark to me, and loses the impact it could have had.</td>', 'I am obviously missing something!  But then, I don''t get out much.  Is the FLOWER the deadly intruder, or is there a deadly intruder that I AM missing???  I like the composition and the DOF, but would like to have seen more light on this side of the flower,  It seems a little dark to me, and loses the impact it could have had.', '2003-08-08 19:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(382170, 32297, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love your shot, and really like the added touch of the date!  Cool concept, great composition, and wonderful color.  Wonder if you used a gradient of some kind, cause I just love that sky!</td>', 'Love your shot, and really like the added touch of the date!  Cool concept, great composition, and wonderful color.  Wonder if you used a gradient of some kind, cause I just love that sky!', '2003-08-08 19:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(382171, 31967, 2553, '<td valign="top">HEY!  That''s the suit that I wear to work!  Don''t talk about it like that!  My gloves are yellow, and go MUCH better with that magenta thing that you''ve got going on.  Funny shot, made me laugh.</td>', 'HEY!  That''s the suit that I wear to work!  Don''t talk about it like that!  My gloves are yellow, and go MUCH better with that magenta thing that you''ve got going on.  Funny shot, made me laugh.', '2003-08-08 19:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(382173, 32347, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cute, simple, wll lit, well composed.  Not as impactful as some other shots in this challenge, but well done.</td>', 'Cute, simple, wll lit, well composed.  Not as impactful as some other shots in this challenge, but well done.', '2003-08-08 19:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(382175, 31958, 1379, '<td valign="top">So spooky!!!  I love the level stare of your model, and the limp quality to his arms.  Awesome.</td>', 'So spooky!!!  I love the level stare of your model, and the limp quality to his arms.  Awesome.', '2003-08-08 19:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(382179, 32069, 1379, '<td valign="top">RIGHT ON!!!  I was desperately hoping someone would embrace the idea of peace for the future, and you came up with a brilliant idea.  I love it!  Your photoshopping is flawless, too.</td>', 'RIGHT ON!!!  I was desperately hoping someone would embrace the idea of peace for the future, and you came up with a brilliant idea.  I love it!  Your photoshopping is flawless, too.', '2003-08-08 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(382181, 32305, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great catchlights in both models.  I love the wary expression on the infant.  Such a delicate photo.</td>', 'Great catchlights in both models.  I love the wary expression on the infant.  Such a delicate photo.', '2003-08-08 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(382195, 32305, 5475, '<td valign="top">What an awesome photo... Gets a 10 from me.  There isn''t much else to say about it!</td>', 'What an awesome photo... Gets a 10 from me.  There isn''t much else to say about it!', '2003-08-08 19:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(382197, 31668, 5475, '<td valign="top">Love the blue tones of this.  Great concept and composition.  I find the one cloud in the center to be a little distracting.  Give the ''no  editing restrictions'' I probably would have cloned it out.  Either way, this is a great shot and I give it a 9!</td>', 'Love the blue tones of this.  Great concept and composition.  I find the one cloud in the center to be a little distracting.  Give the ''no  editing restrictions'' I probably would have cloned it out.  Either way, this is a great shot and I give it a 9!', '2003-08-08 19:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382246, 32259, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I gave you an 8, sorry if this gets DQ''d.  The whole debate going on about everything having to be your own photo is bizarre.  This is still very clearly your art and I thought it was very effective.</td>', 'Hi.  I gave you an 8, sorry if this gets DQ''d.  The whole debate going on about everything having to be your own photo is bizarre.  This is still very clearly your art and I thought it was very effective.', '2003-08-08 21:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
