(382784, 31625, 4805, '<td valign="top">This says ''past'' to me more than ''future'' but nevertheless, it''s about moments in time. The cropping of the boots and helmet definitely don''t do it for me. I''d like to see more space here. Also, the low-contrast black and white is rather washed-out. I''d rather see the shot metered on the headstones in the background.</td>', 'This says ''past'' to me more than ''future'' but nevertheless, it''s about moments in time. The cropping of the boots and helmet definitely don''t do it for me. I''d like to see more space here. Also, the low-contrast black and white is rather washed-out. I''d rather see the shot metered on the headstones in the background.', '2003-08-09 16:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(382787, 32285, 4805, '<td valign="top">It looks remarkably dry in that hallway, considering. I see they still have boobs in the future. That''s remarkably reassuring. One of the better ideas. I think that the contrast could have been higher, but other than that, nicely done.</td>', 'It looks remarkably dry in that hallway, considering. I see they still have boobs in the future. That''s remarkably reassuring. One of the better ideas. I think that the contrast could have been higher, but other than that, nicely done.', '2003-08-09 16:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(382789, 31792, 4805, '<td valign="top">I can hear the ''what does this have to do with the future'' comments from here. Not sure myself (other than the obvious invasive species thing). Cropping is weak, there''s a line along the top...nice low-noise, sharp image otherwise. Canon?</td>', 'I can hear the ''what does this have to do with the future'' comments from here. Not sure myself (other than the obvious invasive species thing). Cropping is weak, there''s a line along the top...nice low-noise, sharp image otherwise. Canon?', '2003-08-09 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(382791, 32297, 4805, '<td valign="top">One of the nicer ones. Great colour. Maybe a tad oversharpened, but it certainly says ''future'' to me.</td>', 'One of the nicer ones. Great colour. Maybe a tad oversharpened, but it certainly says ''future'' to me.', '2003-08-09 17:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(382936, 32069, 9679, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job! This looks so real. And I like the optimistic theme!</td>', 'Fantastic job! This looks so real. And I like the optimistic theme!', '2003-08-10 00:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(382940, 32308, 9679, '<td valign="top">Ingenious idea perfectly executed. 10</td>', 'Ingenious idea perfectly executed. 10', '2003-08-10 00:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(382976, 31625, 8953, '<td valign="top">I am sure people felt that way in ww1 and ww2 as well. War is a waste of civilization. war is a truth of civilization. as long as there exsist those that have there will always be those  that want....Let them take it? your childs freedom or anyone elses? I will stand as a soldier to protect what past generations insured. do I die? maybe. 10 for making us all think what it might be like with out those that want of those that have.</td>', 'I am sure people felt that way in ww1 and ww2 as well. War is a waste of civilization. war is a truth of civilization. as long as there exsist those that have there will always be those  that want....Let them take it? your childs freedom or anyone elses? I will stand as a soldier to protect what past generations insured. do I die? maybe. 10 for making us all think what it might be like with out those that want of those that have.', '2003-08-10 03:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(383016, 32299, 2389, '<td valign="top">A great photo (even though fuzzy/grainy). The expresssions are fantastic.</td>', 'A great photo (even though fuzzy/grainy). The expresssions are fantastic.', '2003-08-10 09:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
