(383038, 31820, 6388, '<td valign="top">brilliant Steve.  FYI, if you take the ultrasound to a blueprinter, it makes a wonderfully frameable image - blueprints are made from negatives too - very cool.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'brilliant Steve.  FYI, if you take the ultrasound to a blueprinter, it makes a wonderfully frameable image - blueprints are made from negatives too - very cool. Pedro', '2003-08-10 11:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
