(383099, 32359, 10263, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh out loud :) Very creative and hopefully not true for the near (or distant) future. The animals are too dark to make out what they are... buffalo?.. but an extra point for making me laugh.</td>', 'This one made me laugh out loud :) Very creative and hopefully not true for the near (or distant) future. The animals are too dark to make out what they are... buffalo?.. but an extra point for making me laugh.', '2003-08-10 13:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
