(387446, 32239, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how the title fits with the image, but the photo is engaging and intriguing enough: lots going on and lots of interesting lines and textures.</td>', 'I''m not sure how the title fits with the image, but the photo is engaging and intriguing enough: lots going on and lots of interesting lines and textures.', '2003-08-13 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
