(401899, 31859, 9437, '<td valign="top">I love the drama of this picture. It''s made even more dramatic by the title. God does make masterpieces. Good job!</td>', 'I love the drama of this picture. It''s made even more dramatic by the title. God does make masterpieces. Good job!', '2003-08-27 19:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(402621, 31783, 656, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like this one so much - the out of focus regions just seem blurry to my eye - maybe gives me a ghostly impression or being dead, but doesn''t quite work for me.  The foreground cross is a strong tonal contrast to everything else, but it would maybe look better with a less over exposed look that kept some more of the texture ?  The jumbled composition just feels haphazard and accidental - particularly the occluded ''murray'' headstone on the right - I can''t tell how much of this was intentional to make it look cluttered vs. accidentally arranged.</td>', 'Not sure I like this one so much - the out of focus regions just seem blurry to my eye - maybe gives me a ghostly impression or being dead, but doesn''t quite work for me.  The foreground cross is a strong tonal contrast to everything else, but it would maybe look better with a less over exposed look that kept some more of the texture ?  The jumbled composition just feels haphazard and accidental - particularly the occluded ''murray'' headstone on the right - I can''t tell how much of this was intentional to make it look cluttered vs. accidentally arranged.', '2003-08-28 11:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(404676, 31668, 1439, '<td valign="top">Mjög flott!!</td>', 'Mjög flott!!', '2003-08-30 14:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(405280, 32302, 1880, '<td valign="top">Hey Gary,<br/> <br/>Just looking around and see you have done it again. Great shot.<br/> <br/>Bob</td>', 'Hey Gary, Just looking around and see you have done it again. Great shot. Bob', '2003-08-31 17:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(406860, 31643, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot and can''t believe it scored so poorly.  I guess many people were looking for a high-tech future, butI understand the significance of your title.  I really like the flame effect you have created - it has a surreal quality about it and would work excellently as a background image (for a card or book for example).  The shapes in the image are really interesting - especially the flames.</td>', 'I really like this shot and can''t believe it scored so poorly.  I guess many people were looking for a high-tech future, butI understand the significance of your title.  I really like the flame effect you have created - it has a surreal quality about it and would work excellently as a background image (for a card or book for example).  The shapes in the image are really interesting - especially the flames.', '2003-09-02 02:43:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(426299, 32305, 9441, '<td valign="top">Wow...wonderful photo!  I love the expression on both faces, and the color and clarity is sooooo good!</td>', 'Wow...wonderful photo!  I love the expression on both faces, and the color and clarity is sooooo good!', '2003-09-22 16:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
